{"id":"9d6016b6be7032da","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics.md","title":"限制与赋值延拓的精确对应","display":"lem-clause-restriction-semantics — 限制与赋值延拓的精确对应","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics","aliases":["72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics"],"display":"lem-clause-restriction-semantics — 限制与赋值延拓的精确对应","depends_on":["[[72-df-clause-restriction]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §9.2; complete local extension argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-clause-restriction-semantics — 限制与赋值延拓的精确对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9bb16015e70c461\" href=\"?note=e9bb16015e70c461\" title=\"72-df-clause-restriction\">72-df-clause-restriction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §9.2; complete local extension argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,D,\\rho\">\\(F,D,\\rho\\)</span> 沿用限制定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus D\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus D\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\cup\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\">\\(a\\cup\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\models_{\\rm cnf}(F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\na\\cup\\rho\\models_{\\rm cnf}F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\models_{\\rm cnf}(F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\na\\cup\\rho\\models_{\\rm cnf}F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Unsat}(F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Unsat}(F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>被删掉的整条子句已有一个由ρ给真的文字；未删子句的已赋文字全部假，故其真值恰由剩下文字决定。逐子句得到等价。若限制可满足，则用ρ补齐得到原集合满足赋值，与原不可满足性矛盾。逆向的不可满足性蕴涵不成立，因为一次不合适的固定赋值可能破坏本来可满足的公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-clause-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e9bb16015e70c461","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-restriction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,D,\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus D\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\cup\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Asn}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\models_{\\rm cnf}(F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\na\\cup\\rho\\models_{\\rm cnf}F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Unsat}(F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho).","display":true}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"